</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In PTQTP: Post-Training Quantization to Trit-Planes for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Full Results</span></a></li>
